📜 🔤todos.🍇🔤

📗
  Builds the app, in two steps with the settings between them, as ASP.NET has
  a builder and then an app:

    🌱🐇🏗❗️ ➡️ app      a new app, with the sample's settings declared
    📂 app❗️             the config file and the environment over them
    🍷🐇🏗 app❗️          middleware and routes, from the settings as they now are

  Shared by main.🍇 (the real server) and tests.🍇 (in memory, where a test
  sets what it wants in place of 📂), the same split as Program.cs and
  WebApplicationFactory.
📗
